First Term Examination, 2013-14Course: B. Tech. (CSE), Year: II, Semester: IVComputer Nefworks (CSE224)
Uni. Roll No:Time: 1.5 Hrs.
Total Marks: 20
Notes:l. All parts of a question should be answered at one place.2. Answer should be brief and to-the-point and be supplemented with neat sketches.3. Any missing or wrong data may be assumed suitably giving proper justification.4. Figures on tlte right-hand side nrargin indicate full marks
Section A
Note: Attempt All Questions (1x5:5)I. What are the responsibilities of the transport layer in the TCP/P model?II. Design a hybrid topology with star backbone connecting two bus backbones.Each bus backbone connects three ring networks.III. If the peak voltage value of a signal is 20 times the peak voltage value of thenoise, what is the SNR? What is the SNR in db?IV. Differentiate between Base band and broad band transmission.V. Differentiate between point to point and multipoint connection.
Note: Attempt anv Three Questions (2x3=6)I. Draw the graph of manchester and differential manchester scheme for thefollowing data stream-i. 11010010ii. 01101100il. Name the advantages of optical fiber over twisted pair and coaxial cable?III. Compare and contrast a datagram network and virtual circuit network? A path indigital circuit switched network has a data rate of 10 Mbps. The exchange of 1000bits required for setup and tear down phases. The distance between two parties is 500km. What is the total delay, if 10000 bits of data are exchanged during data transferphase?IV. What is computer network topology? Explain any three topologies with diagram.

