Univ. Roll No.--------course: B.Tech. ll year, I Mid rerm {Even sem.},Examination,2013-14Subject: Environmental Studies (CEE 201)
Time:90 MinutesNotes:
M.M.:20
1' Answer All questions from section A, 03 questions from section B & 03 questions from section c.2. All questions of the particular Section should be answered collectively at one place.3' Answer should be to the point and wherever requireci, be supplemented with neat sketches.4. Any missing data mav be assumed suitably giving proper jrrstificaiion. .
5. Figure on the right hand side margin indicate marks
section-A (Attempt All questions) (01x 05= 05 marks|l. When the World Environment Day is observed ?ll. What are saprophytes ?lll. What is meant by rain water harvesting ?lV. How food chain contributes to the stabirity of an ecosystem ?V. Why afforestation is needed ?section-B {Attempt any three questions) {02 x 03 =06 marks}l' How Environmental studies is irnportant in view of conservation of naturalresources?ll' Discuss environmental consequences of over exploitation of mineral resources.lll' classify the natural ecosystem on the basis of surroiinding by giving suitableexamples.lV' suggest some effective methods to solve the problem of water crisis.Section-C (Attempt any three questions) (03 X 03 =09 marksll' Explain the structure and functions of atmosphere with the help of neat labefleddiagram,ll. what is ecological succession ? Exprain it's types by giving.suitabre exampres.tll' Explain structural and functional features of biotic components in an ecosystem.lV. Enumerate environmental effects of deforestation.

