50) Self confidence in a person implies-A) The ability to do anythingC) Taking a risk iri grey areas
B) Feeling confident in all the areas of lifeD) Using past experience for anyaction
Read the following and answer Questions 5l - SS:Malini is a bright student and has high hopes for her future. On the day before the examinations, she decides to spendher time alone doing some revisions of her lessons. When she is engrossed in her work, one of her friends approachesher to clear some doubts. Malini gets very impatient and tells her that she can't do it. The friend feels thaf Mafini isvery rude and decides never to interact with her again.5l) What is the main reason of a negative outcome in this sinration?
A) Physiological factorsB) Malini's friend's behaviourC) Noise in communication"lY**:::::: -)52) What is the barrier in this case?A) he conceived NotionsB) StessC) PhysiologicalD) Impatience
53) What is the filter in this case?A) LanguageB) DisinterestC) RigidAttitudeD) Superiority Complex
54) What Malini could have done to handle the situation better?A) Showed patience and politenessB) Showed PityC) Avoided hbr friendD) Showed sympathy
55) What Malini's friend could have done to handle the situation better?A) Be aggressiveB) Be persistentC) Showed empathyD) Showed sympathy
